1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,960
-Hey. I got some bad news. -What?
-有個壞消息 -什麼？

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:10,470
That's no way to sell newspapers. Try, "Extra! Extra! Read all about it!"
那不是賣報紙的好方法 試試「快報，快來買喔」

3
00:00:10,810 --> 00:00:14,870
No. Monica's restaurant got a horrible review in the Post.
不，摩妮卡的餐廳 在紐約郵報上的評價很差

4
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:21,480
I didn't want her to see it, so I ran around and bought all the copies.
我不希望她看到它 所以跑遍附近報攤買下所有報紙

5
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:25,350
Two, four, six, one million. Yeah, you got them all.
二，四，六，一百萬 對，你把它們都買回來了

6
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:29,950
This is bad. And I've had bad reviews.
這真的很糟糕 我一直都被批評的很凶

7
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:32,160
I remember my first good one:
我還記得我第一次被讚美

8
00:00:32,330 --> 00:00:35,390
"Everything else in Our Town was terrible.
在《我們的小鎮》裡 其他的事都很糟糕

9
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:38,560
Joey Tribbiani was abysmal."
喬伊崔比亞尼是個無底洞

10
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:44,900
Oh, my God! Look at all the newspapers.
我的天啊 看看這些報紙

11
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:49,010
It must be a good review. Is it great?
評價一定很不錯，對吧？

12
00:00:53,150 --> 00:00:54,380
Oh, dear God.
我的天啊

13
00:00:54,580 --> 00:01:00,020
But the good news is, no one in a two-block radius will ever know.
但好消息是 兩條街裡沒有人會知道

14
00:01:00,190 --> 00:01:03,420
-And the rest of Manhattan? -They all know.
-曼哈頓其他的人呢？ -他們都會知道

15
00:01:04,190 --> 00:01:08,390
Oh, my God, this is horrible. I'm so humiliated.
天啊，這太可怕了 我覺得好丟臉

16
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:12,160
They say there's no such thing as bad press.
人家不是說沒有所謂的負面報導

17
00:01:12,370 --> 00:01:17,770
You don't think that "the mahi-mahi was awful-awful" is bad press?
你不覺得「鬼頭刀難吃極了」 是負面報導嗎？

18
00:01:19,710 --> 00:01:21,730
I didn't write it.
那又不是我寫的

19
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:25,800
-God, is he right? Am I awful? -Oh, no!
-天啊，他說的對嗎？我很遜嗎？ -不

20
00:01:26,050 --> 00:01:27,610
Monica, listen to me.
摩妮卡，聽我說

21
00:01:27,780 --> 00:01:31,150
I'm not just saying this because I'm your friend.
我這麼做 不只因為我是你的朋友

22
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:34,580
Your food is abysmal!
你的食物是個無底洞

23
00:01:35,628 --> 00:01:37,755
The One With The Cooking Class
本集播出：烹飪課程

00:01:38,628 --> 00:01:39,755
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

24
00:02:17,070 --> 00:02:20,000
-Ross? -What? What?
-羅斯 -什麼？

25
00:02:20,170 --> 00:02:23,830
-I am freaking out! -Are you?
-我快嚇死了 -是嗎？

27
00:02:24,370 --> 00:02:26,530
My due date is in one week!
我的預產期是一星期後

28
00:02:26,710 --> 00:02:29,640
-What are you doing up? -That is seven days.
-你為什麼不睡覺？ -只剩七天

29
00:02:29,810 --> 00:02:32,970
I had a lot of water. Can we do this after..?
我睡前喝了太多水 我們可不可以晚一點再…

30
00:02:33,180 --> 00:02:34,940
No, no, no, no, Ross!
不，羅斯

31
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:37,850
We don't have any big stuff we need.
我們沒有準備任何東西

32
00:02:38,020 --> 00:02:41,350
We don't have a changing table or a crib.
我們沒買尿布台或搖籃

33
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:46,360
-We do not have a diaper service. -Funny you should mention diapers.
-我們甚至沒買尿布 -你現在提起尿布太有趣了

34
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:50,760
-I'm serious. -There's nothing to worry about.
-我是認真的 -沒什麼好擔心的

35
00:02:50,930 --> 00:02:54,960
There's a baby store on West 10th. We'll go there..
西10街有家嬰兒用品專賣店 我們到那裡去…

36
00:02:55,140 --> 00:02:59,770
-and get everything we need. Okay? -Okay. Thank you. That's great.
-買我們需要的東西，好嗎？ -好吧，謝謝你，太棒了

37
00:02:59,940 --> 00:03:03,000
Where on West 10th? There's a shoe store..
西10街在哪裡？ 那裡有家鞋店…

38
00:03:03,310 --> 00:03:07,840
Okay. If you're gonna do this, then I'm gonna go do that, so..
好吧，如果你要這麼做 我要那麼做，所以…

39
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:11,720
-Wait, Ross! I'm sorry, one more thing. -Yeah.
-等一下，羅斯，抱歉，還有一件事 -對

40
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:15,980
Our situation, you know, what we mean to each other..
我們的情況 我們對彼此的意義…

41
00:03:16,220 --> 00:03:21,690
and, I mean, we're having this baby together and we live together..
我是說我們要一起撫養孩子 我們要住在一起…

42
00:03:21,860 --> 00:03:25,260
Isn't that..? Isn't that weird?
那…那不是很奇怪嗎？

43
00:03:30,740 --> 00:03:31,970
Well..
喔…

44
00:03:32,210 --> 00:03:34,970
I'm just kidding. You can go pee.
我只是在開玩笑，你可以去上廁所了

45
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:43,050
Did we say we were gonna meet here or at the movie?
我們約好在這裡 或是在電影院裡碰面？

46
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:46,690
-We said at the movies, but.. -I'll see you there.
-我們約好在電影院裡碰面，但是… -我們到電影院見

47
00:03:46,850 --> 00:03:51,660
-Now that you're here..? -I'll hang out till I have to meet you.
-既然你來了… -跟你們碰面之前先和你們混

48
00:03:51,990 --> 00:03:55,690
-How come you're not going? -I've got a job interview.
-你為什麼不去？ -我要去面試一個新工作

49
00:03:55,900 --> 00:04:00,890
-I thought you already have a job. -And they say you don't pay attention.
-我以為你已經有工作了 -大家還說你不太關心別人

50
00:04:01,070 --> 00:04:04,940
It's a better job. It's vice president of the company..
這份工作比較好 它是一家公司的副總裁…

51
00:04:05,110 --> 00:04:09,040
that does data reconfiguration for other companies.
這家公司為其他公司 做資料重構

52
00:04:10,550 --> 00:04:15,310
-Wow. How do you know how to do that? -That's what I do now.
-你怎麼知道該怎麼做？ -那就是我現在的工作

53
00:04:16,520 --> 00:04:18,750
-Joey? Come taste this. -What?
-喬伊，來試吃一下 -什麼？

54
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:22,410
Remember the guy that gave me a bad review? Well..
還記得給我爛評價的那個人嗎？ 喔…

55
00:04:22,620 --> 00:04:25,590
I'm getting my revenge.
我要跟他報復

56
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:28,050
You cooked him?
你把他煮了？

57
00:04:28,460 --> 00:04:32,090
No. He teaches a course at The New School..
不，他在新校 開了一堂課…

58
00:04:32,330 --> 00:04:35,630
I want to make him try my bouillabaisse again.
我要他再試試 我的馬賽魚湯

59
00:04:35,870 --> 00:04:39,100
I can't wait to read the front page tomorrow:
我等不及要看 明天的報紙頭條

60
00:04:39,270 --> 00:04:44,040
"Restaurant reviewer admits: 'I was wrong about Monica.'"
「餐廳評鑒家承認： 我錯怪了摩妮卡」

61
00:04:44,380 --> 00:04:46,280
The front page?
頭版？

62
00:04:46,450 --> 00:04:50,250
You really do live in your own little world, don't you?
你真的活在你的小世界裡 對吧？

63
00:04:51,190 --> 00:04:54,810
-I better get to my movie. -Oh, yeah.
-我最好快去看電影 -對

64
00:04:54,990 --> 00:04:57,920
If I'm going to the movie and you're going to the movie..
如果我要去電影院 你也要去電影院…

65
00:04:58,090 --> 00:05:00,220
why don't we just go together?
我們為什麼不一起去？

66
00:05:00,900 --> 00:05:03,660
How's that for data reconfiguration, huh, Chand?
這個資料重構還不錯吧？ 錢德

67
00:05:11,070 --> 00:05:13,470
My name's Katie if there's anything else you need.
我是凱蒂 很高興能為你們服務

68
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:17,410
Oh, God, I don't know. I want.. Everything is so great, I just want everything.
天啊，我不知道，我要… 這裡的東西好棒，我要通通買下來

69
00:05:17,580 --> 00:05:20,450
Oh, look at this. We need this!
你看，我們需要這個

70
00:05:20,620 --> 00:05:22,340
-What is it? -I don't know.
-它是什麼？ -我不知道

71
00:05:24,390 --> 00:05:27,050
Have you ever had two people who weren't wearing crowns..
你們曾經有過 兩個客人不穿小丑裝…

72
00:05:27,220 --> 00:05:28,590
spend this much money here?
卻在這裡花了這麼多錢的記錄嗎？

73
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:31,380
You have selected a lot of nice things.
你們選了很多好東西

74
00:05:32,060 --> 00:05:34,690
You want these delivered, Mr. and Mrs. Geller?
需要我們做外送服務嗎？ 蓋勒先生跟蓋勒太太

75
00:05:34,860 --> 00:05:36,920
-Oh, no, no. -No, no.
-不 -不

76
00:05:37,170 --> 00:05:40,000
-We're not married. -We are having a baby..
-我們沒有結婚 -我們的孩子快出世了…

77
00:05:40,270 --> 00:05:42,260
but we're not involved.
但我們沒有結婚

78
00:05:42,470 --> 00:05:46,700
I mean, we were seeing each other a while ago..
我是說 我們曾經交往過…

79
00:05:46,870 --> 00:05:52,140
but then we were just friends, and then there was one drunken night..
之後我們變成了朋友 有天晚上我們喝醉了…

80
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:58,240
Or, yes, stranger, we'd like this delivered, please.
對，陌生人 我們需要外送服務

81
00:05:58,420 --> 00:06:01,620
-Can you fill out this address card? -Oh, okay.
-麻煩你填一下住址 -好的

82
00:06:02,220 --> 00:06:05,160
-You picked out a lot of dinosaurs. -Yeah.
-你挑了很多恐龍 -對

83
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:09,090
That's one of the reasons why we're not a couple.
所以那也就是為什麼 我們沒有結婚

84
00:06:09,330 --> 00:06:11,920
I chose those. I'm a paleontologist.
我選了那些，我是古生物學家

85
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:14,470
Really? That is so cool.
真的嗎？那太酷了

86
00:06:14,700 --> 00:06:20,330
Don't get too worked up. It sounds like he's a doctor, but he's not.
別太誇他 你可能以為他是博士，但事實上不然

87
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:23,000
No. I'm fascinated by paleontology.
不，我喜歡古生物學

88
00:06:23,180 --> 00:06:27,310
-Have you read the Walter Alvarez book? -I teach it in class.
-你看過華特艾瓦瑞茲的書嗎？ -它是我的教科書

89
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:32,920
Standing at a cash register, I'm holding a credit card, and I'm bored.
我站在收銀台，手裡拿著信用卡 卻覺得很無聊

90
00:06:33,550 --> 00:06:37,890
I love your neighborhood. There's a great gym around the corner.
我喜歡你住的社區 街角有家很棒的健身房

91
00:06:38,060 --> 00:06:42,020
-That's my gym. -I could tell you work out.
-那是我的健身房 -我看得出來你有健身

92
00:06:46,870 --> 00:06:51,600
A paleontologist who works out. You're like Indiana Jones.
一位會健身的古生物學家 你跟印第安納瓊斯一樣

93
00:06:55,410 --> 00:06:57,740
I am like Indiana Jones.
我是跟印第安納瓊斯一樣

94
00:07:04,750 --> 00:07:08,520
-Hi, Pheebs. -Hey! Oh, how did baby shopping go?
-嗨，菲比 -寶寶的東西買得怎麼樣了？

95
00:07:08,690 --> 00:07:11,280
Great! We got everything we needed.
太棒了，我們需要的東西都買到了

96
00:07:11,460 --> 00:07:15,590
Oh, and Ross almost got something that wasn't on the list.
羅斯差點拿到 清單上沒有的東西

97
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:17,920
A whore.
一個妓女

98
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:19,430
What?
什麼？

99
00:07:19,930 --> 00:07:24,740
We were paying, and this sales woman just started flirting with him.
我們正在付帳 這個女銷售員開始泡他

100
00:07:24,910 --> 00:07:26,400
Can you believe that?
你能相信嗎？

101
00:07:26,610 --> 00:07:30,810
-Did she know you two weren't married? -Yeah.
-她知道你們沒有結婚嗎？ -知道

102
00:07:30,980 --> 00:07:36,280
Oh, my God. Well, the idea.. A woman flirting with a single man?
天啊，那… 一個女人在泡一個單身男人？

103
00:07:36,450 --> 00:07:39,440
-We must alert the church elders. -No.
-我們得通知教會的長老 -不

104
00:07:40,250 --> 00:07:44,090
You don't understand. You didn't see how brazen she was.
你不瞭解 你沒看到她多不要臉

105
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:47,630
-Sounds like you're jealous. -No, I'm not.
-你好像在吃醋 -我才沒有

106
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:51,890
I just think it's wrong. I mean, here I am, about to pop..
我只是覺得那是不對的 我是說我就快生了…

107
00:07:52,070 --> 00:07:56,470
and he's out picking up some shopgirl at Sluts-R-Us?
他在蕩婦專門店泡女人？

108
00:07:57,640 --> 00:08:00,130
Is that a real place?
真的有那種地方嗎？

109
00:08:00,410 --> 00:08:02,900
Are they hiring?
他們有缺人嗎？

110
00:08:03,980 --> 00:08:07,070
Hey, Phoebe. Fatty.
嘿，菲比，肥婆

111
00:08:08,450 --> 00:08:10,080
Why so fancy?
你為什麼那麼高興？

112
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:12,010
I got a job interview.
我得到一個面試機會

113
00:08:12,190 --> 00:08:16,090
It's more money, and I'd be doing data reconfiguration.
薪水比較高 我要做資料重構的工作

114
00:08:16,290 --> 00:08:21,280
-I think I know someone who does that. -Me. I do that.
-我知道有個人就做那一行 -那就是我

115
00:08:21,700 --> 00:08:24,130
So do I look okay? I'm nervous.
我看起來還好吧？ 我好緊張

116
00:08:24,330 --> 00:08:26,320
Oh, yeah. You look great.
對，你看起來很棒

117
00:08:26,830 --> 00:08:29,770
You know, just don't get your hopes up.
別抱太高的希望

118
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:32,800
-Why not? -Well, the interview.
-為什麼？ -你要去面試

119
00:08:33,010 --> 00:08:34,440
-Yeah? -You know.
-所以呢？ -你知道的

120
00:08:34,610 --> 00:08:37,940
You don't make a very good first impression.
你無法給人留下良好的第一印象

121
00:08:38,310 --> 00:08:41,340
-What? -Oh, you don't know.
-什麼？ -喔，你不知道啊

122
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:46,490
-Are you serious? -When I first met you, you were like:
-你是說真的嗎？ -我第一次見到你，你是這樣的

123
00:08:46,650 --> 00:08:49,780
I was like:
我就覺得…

124
00:08:52,490 --> 00:08:54,290
What is it that I do?
我怎麼了？

125
00:08:54,500 --> 00:08:58,230
It's just, like, you're trying too hard, making jokes..
你太努力想要說笑話…

126
00:08:58,430 --> 00:09:00,700
You come off a little needy.
你太急了

127
00:09:00,870 --> 00:09:03,340
Did you like me when we first met?
我們第一次見面時，你喜歡我嗎？

128
00:09:03,670 --> 00:09:09,540
Chandler, I'm not gonna lie to you. But I am gonna run away from you.
錢德，我不想騙你 但我要離開了

129
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:15,280
She's put on so much weight.
她胖了太多

130
00:09:20,790 --> 00:09:22,620
There he is.
他在那裡

131
00:09:22,790 --> 00:09:25,050
That smug bastard.
天殺的王八蛋

132
00:09:25,790 --> 00:09:27,760
Okay, class. We'll see you next time.
好了，同學們 下次見

133
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,560
There he is.
他在那裡

134
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:38,030
Hi. I'm Monica Geller, chef at Allessandro's.
嗨，我是摩妮卡蓋勒 亞利山多洛斯的主廚

135
00:09:38,370 --> 00:09:40,240
Still?
現在還是？

136
00:09:40,410 --> 00:09:42,670
The things you said were unfair..
你說的評論有點不公平…

137
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:46,210
and I want you to try my bouillabaisse again.
我要你再試試 我的馬賽魚湯

138
00:09:46,380 --> 00:09:49,350
I don't see why I'd do that to myself again.
我看不出來 我有什麼原因再試一次

139
00:09:49,550 --> 00:09:52,520
Either eat it or be in it.
你不吃就倒霉

140
00:09:53,220 --> 00:09:55,380
Spoon?
湯匙？

141
00:09:59,690 --> 00:10:02,250
-What do you think? -I'm torn..
-你覺得呢？ -我很為難…

142
00:10:02,430 --> 00:10:07,230
between my integrity and my desire to avoid a beating.
不知道要老實說 還是避免自己被打一頓

143
00:10:07,400 --> 00:10:12,860
But I must be honest. Your soup is abysmal.
但我得老實說 你的湯是個無底洞

144
00:10:13,980 --> 00:10:19,440
Thattagirl! We should get out of here, there's a new class coming in.
做的好，我們應該離開這裡 新的一班要上課了

145
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:22,270
Welcome to lntroduction to Cooking.
歡迎大家來上烹調入門

146
00:10:22,450 --> 00:10:27,620
Can anyone tell me the difference between hollandaise and bearnaise sauce?
誰能告訴我荷蘭酸味蘸醬 貝納斯醬的差別？

147
00:10:28,820 --> 00:10:30,980
-I can. -Okay, go ahead.
-我知道 -請說

148
00:10:31,230 --> 00:10:34,820
Well, they both have a egg yolk and butter base.
它們都放了蛋黃 跟奶油

149
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:39,830
But a bearnaise has shallots, chervil, and most importantly, tarragon.
但貝納斯醬有放蔥、雪維菜 跟最重要的小龍艾

150
00:10:40,300 --> 00:10:42,770
-Very good. What's your name? -Monica.
-非常好，你叫什麼名字？  -摩妮卡

151
00:10:42,940 --> 00:10:46,960
-You go to the head of the class! -Okay!
-你來當班長 -好吧

153
00:10:49,810 --> 00:10:52,340
This stuff takes up a lot of room.
這些玩意占好多空間喔

154
00:10:52,580 --> 00:10:56,140
How serious are you about keeping Ben in your life?
你說你要留班一輩子 你有多認真？

155
00:10:56,820 --> 00:11:00,150
My son? Pretty serious.
我的兒子嗎？我非常認真

156
00:11:06,490 --> 00:11:08,960
Hi, Katie. What are you doing here?
嗨，凱蒂 你來這裡做什麼？

157
00:11:09,160 --> 00:11:11,960
The delivery went out and they forgot this.
外送部忘了這個

158
00:11:12,170 --> 00:11:17,800
It must have been obvious, since it was the only thing left in your store.
這一定很明顯 因為它是你店裡唯一剩下的東西

159
00:11:17,970 --> 00:11:24,040
Listen, to be honest, home deliveries aren't really part of my job description.
聽著，老實說 我的工作不包括送貨到家服務

160
00:11:26,610 --> 00:11:31,280
Oh, I actually came here to ask you out.
我是來這裡約你的

161
00:11:31,550 --> 00:11:35,850
Oh. Wow. Yeah, that sounds great.
哇 那聽起來很棒

162
00:11:36,060 --> 00:11:42,490
I'm just gonna put this back in my pocket and pretend that didn't happen.
我要把這個放回我的口袋 假裝那件事沒有發生過

163
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:45,260
I'm free now. You want to get coffee..?
現在我有空 你要去喝咖啡嗎…？

164
00:11:45,470 --> 00:11:49,160
-Sure. -Horny bitch.
-當然好 -蕩婦

165
00:11:51,910 --> 00:11:56,140
No, you're a horny bitch! No, you're a horny bitch!
不，你是蕩婦 不，你是蕩婦

166
00:11:56,310 --> 00:11:59,140
No, you're a horny bitch!
不，你是蕩婦

167
00:11:59,310 --> 00:12:01,470
You guys have a good time.
祝你們玩得愉快

168
00:12:01,680 --> 00:12:05,350
I'm just gonna grab my coat. And my whip.
我去拿我的外套跟鞭子

169
00:12:06,790 --> 00:12:10,120
You know, because of lndiana Jones.
因為我像印第安納瓊斯

170
00:12:11,790 --> 00:12:15,560
Not because I'm into S & M.
不是因為我喜歡性虐待

171
00:12:15,860 --> 00:12:18,660
I'm not into anything weird, you know?
我沒有怪癖，你知道嗎？

172
00:12:18,830 --> 00:12:20,990
Just normal sex.
我只喜歡一般的性愛

173
00:12:24,310 --> 00:12:26,970
So I'm gonna grab my coat.
我去拿外套

174
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:36,870
So you had a good day, huh? Big commission, picked up a daddy.
你今天過得很不錯嘛？ 泡老爸賺大佣金

175
00:12:37,950 --> 00:12:39,940
Are you okay with this?
你沒問題吧？

176
00:12:40,150 --> 00:12:43,720
Oh, yeah. Yeah, please. You guys have fun.
當然，拜託 你們好好玩吧

177
00:12:43,890 --> 00:12:45,220
-Okay. -Yeah.
-好吧 -對

178
00:12:45,390 --> 00:12:46,620
Nice to see you.
很高興能見到你

179
00:12:46,830 --> 00:12:51,230
Oh, and it was great to see you too. And you look fantastic.
我也是 你看起來好極了

180
00:12:51,470 --> 00:12:55,460
-Although you missed a button. -Oh, actually, I..
-雖然你有顆釦子忘了扣 -事實上我…

181
00:12:55,670 --> 00:12:58,370
Oh, okay, I see what you're doing there.
好吧 我知道你想做什麼

182
00:13:01,510 --> 00:13:05,410
I can't even believe this. I really come off that badly?
我不敢相信 我的形象有那麼糟？

183
00:13:05,580 --> 00:13:08,380
It's okay. You calm down after a while..
那沒什麼 不久後你會靜下來…

184
00:13:08,550 --> 00:13:11,920
and then people see how wonderful you are.
大家會瞭解你有多棒

185
00:13:12,150 --> 00:13:15,850
Good. Because I'm sure this interview will last weeks.
好吧，因為我相信 這次面試會維持好幾個星期

186
00:13:16,060 --> 00:13:20,390
All right, don't freak out, okay? I will help you.
好吧，別驚慌 我會幫你的

187
00:13:20,560 --> 00:13:24,260
-How long before you have to leave? -An hour.
-你什麼時候要出發？ -一小時後

188
00:13:24,470 --> 00:13:27,030
-I can't help you. -Phoebe..
-我幫不了你 -菲比…

189
00:13:27,230 --> 00:13:32,700
We'll do our best. I'm the interviewer and I'm meeting you for the first time.
我們得盡力而為，我是面試官 我第一次跟你見面

190
00:13:32,870 --> 00:13:36,970
-Okay. -Hi. Come on in. I'm Regina Phalanges.
-好吧 -請進，我是蕾吉娜菲蘭吉斯

191
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,980
-Chandler Bing. -Oh, Bing.
-錢德賓 -賓

192
00:13:40,180 --> 00:13:43,980
-What an unusual name. -You should meet my Uncle Bada.
-你的名字很罕見 -你應該見見我的巴達叔叔

193
00:13:50,190 --> 00:13:52,790
I'll let myself out.
我自己出去

194
00:13:59,030 --> 00:14:02,160
Your alfredo's dry. Did you use your cheese?
你的意大利寬條面有點干 你有放起司嗎？

195
00:14:02,370 --> 00:14:07,530
When you say "use, " do you mean "eat as a pre-cooking snack"?
你說「放」是指 「把它當作菜前的點心吃掉了」嗎？

196
00:14:08,180 --> 00:14:11,440
-And the cream? -Cheese makes me thirsty.
-奶油呢？ -起司讓我口渴

197
00:14:13,180 --> 00:14:16,810
-Okay. Let's move on. -All right.
-好吧，我們繼續 -好吧

198
00:14:17,850 --> 00:14:21,790
Something smells good over at Monica's station.
摩妮卡做的菜 味道很香

199
00:14:22,820 --> 00:14:26,780
My God! This is amazing! You've never made this before?
天啊，這真的是太好吃了 你從來沒有做過這個？

200
00:14:26,990 --> 00:14:30,690
Oh, no. I don't know anything about cooking.
不 我不懂烹飪

201
00:14:30,900 --> 00:14:35,770
I had to ask what it was called when the water makes those bubbles.
我不知道水冒泡後 要做什麼

202
00:14:36,500 --> 00:14:40,960
-Hats off to the chef. -Your mouth was full. I didn't hear.
-向主廚致意 -你嘴裡都是東西，我聽不到

203
00:14:41,140 --> 00:14:43,170
-Hats off to who? -The chef!
-跟誰致意？ -主廚

204
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:45,710
That's right!
沒錯

205
00:14:47,550 --> 00:14:53,180
You'll find that I don't micromanage. I don't shy away from delegating.
你會發現我不會事必躬親 我不害怕溝通

206
00:14:53,350 --> 00:14:58,020
That's good to know. But let's stop focusing on what you don't do..
那真的很棒 但別談那些你不會做的事…

207
00:14:58,190 --> 00:15:00,320
and focus on what you do do.
我們來談談你會做的事

208
00:15:03,530 --> 00:15:05,900
What I do do..
我會…

209
00:15:08,140 --> 00:15:13,040
is create an atmosphere of support for the people working with me.
支援為我工作的人

210
00:15:13,270 --> 00:15:15,900
Nice sidestep on the "do do" thing.
你剛剛迴避的很巧妙

211
00:15:16,110 --> 00:15:19,770
-Hardest thing I've ever done. -Oh, you gotta go!
-那是我做過最難的事 -你得出發了

212
00:15:20,210 --> 00:15:22,710
-Don't worry. You're ready. -Really?
-別擔心，你準備好了 -真的嗎？

213
00:15:22,950 --> 00:15:28,410
Absolutely! Just fight all your natural instincts, and you'll be great.
當然，跟著你的直覺走 你會很棒的

214
00:15:29,620 --> 00:15:31,920
Monica, check these out.
摩妮卡，你看

215
00:15:33,290 --> 00:15:34,820
Those look like cookies.
那看起來像餅乾

216
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:37,050
I know, yeah. And I made them all by myself.
我知道 完全是我自己做的

217
00:15:37,230 --> 00:15:40,200
I mixed the ingredients, I put them in the oven, I took them out.
我混合所有材料 將它們放進烤箱裡再拿出來

218
00:15:40,370 --> 00:15:43,770
Granted, I should have used the oven mitts, but still.
我不知道要用隔熱手套 但沒關係

219
00:15:44,310 --> 00:15:46,360
Monica, my star student.
摩妮卡，我的明星學生

220
00:15:46,540 --> 00:15:51,810
You called me that before, so I fashioned a star out of foil.
之前你那麼叫我 所以我用錫箔紙做了一顆星星

221
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:56,380
Now, no pressure. If you like my cookies, you give me the star.
別覺得壓力太大 如果你喜歡我的餅乾，給我一顆星星

222
00:16:01,020 --> 00:16:03,420
Wow, a star!
一顆星星

223
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:08,420
I know you all hate me, and I'm sorry, but I don't care.
我知道你們都恨我 對不起，但我不在乎

224
00:16:08,830 --> 00:16:12,230
-Okay, Joey, you're up next. -Yeah.
-好吧，喬伊，下一個是你 -是的

225
00:16:14,030 --> 00:16:17,160
Oh, my God! This is amazing!
天啊，這真的是太棒了

226
00:16:17,340 --> 00:16:19,270
You get an A.
你得到優等

227
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:24,140
I got an A? In school? Hey, I'm a dork!
我在學校裡得到優等？ 我是個書獃子了

228
00:16:25,610 --> 00:16:27,710
Joey, I'm so proud of you.
喬伊，我非常以你為榮

229
00:16:27,880 --> 00:16:30,980
-I think you should give him your star. -Excuse me?
-我想你該把你的星星給他 -你說什麼？

230
00:16:32,590 --> 00:16:36,650
-He doesn't know what he's doing. -Nobody knows what they're doing.
-他不知道自己在做什麼 -初學者沒有人知道自己在做什麼

231
00:16:36,860 --> 00:16:40,050
I do. I'm a professional chef!
我知道，我是職業主廚

232
00:16:40,290 --> 00:16:43,290
Oh, relax. It's not a courtroom drama.
少來了，這又不是法律影集

233
00:16:43,460 --> 00:16:46,330
Why are you taking Introduction to Cooking?
如果你是專業主廚 為什麼要上初級烹調課？

234
00:16:46,530 --> 00:16:48,260
Yeah!
就是嘛

235
00:16:49,670 --> 00:16:53,540
I'm sorry. I cook at this restaurant, Allessandro's..
抱歉 我是亞利山多洛斯餐廳的主廚…

236
00:16:53,710 --> 00:16:55,870
and I just got a bad review.
我得到了很差的評論

237
00:16:56,080 --> 00:16:58,980
-Allessandro's? I love that place! -You do?
-亞利山多洛斯？我喜歡那個地方 -是嗎？

238
00:16:59,150 --> 00:17:02,340
You're a great chef. As a person you're a little..
你是個很棒的主廚 但你的個性有點…

239
00:17:02,550 --> 00:17:06,420
-Oh, I'm crazy, but you liked the food? -Very much.
-我是很瘋狂，但你喜歡那裡的食物？ -非常喜歡

240
00:17:06,590 --> 00:17:10,990
Okay, then. I don't stink. I'm a good chef! Okay.
好吧，那麼我不賴 我是個好主廚，好吧

241
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:13,590
I don't want to go. I'm having fun.
我不想離開，我玩得很開心

242
00:17:13,790 --> 00:17:16,490
Did either of you pay for this class?
你們有付學費嗎？

243
00:17:16,700 --> 00:17:20,600
Hey, if my friend says it's time to go, it's time to go!
如果我的朋友說 我們該走了，我們就該離開

244
00:17:28,210 --> 00:17:33,870
I was the point person on my company's transition from the KL5 to GR6 systems.
我在我的公司負責KL5系統 轉換到GR6系統的工作

245
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:38,450
-You must have had your hands full. -That I did. That I did.
-你一定忙得不可開交 -沒錯，沒錯

246
00:17:38,950 --> 00:17:42,750
So let's talk a little bit about your duties.
我們來談談你的責任吧

247
00:17:46,460 --> 00:17:48,590
My duties?
我的責任？

248
00:17:51,830 --> 00:17:53,060
All right.
好吧

249
00:17:53,270 --> 00:17:57,700
You'll be heading a whole division, so you'll have a lot of duties.
你將負責一整個部門 所以你得負起很多責任

250
00:18:00,610 --> 00:18:04,410
-I see. -But there'll be 30 people under you..
-我瞭解 -你手下會有30個人…

251
00:18:04,580 --> 00:18:07,600
so you can dump a certain amount on them.
你可以把很多工作分給他們

252
00:18:11,620 --> 00:18:14,780
-Good to know. -We could go into detail..
-那太好了 -我們可以仔細地…

253
00:18:14,990 --> 00:18:16,980
No, don't, I beg of you.
不，我求你

254
00:18:17,160 --> 00:18:21,060
All right. We'll have a definite answer for you on Monday.
好吧 我們會在星期一回覆你

255
00:18:21,230 --> 00:18:25,390
But I can say with some confidence, you'll fit in well here.
但我相信 你在這裡會適應的很好

256
00:18:25,730 --> 00:18:28,670
-Really? -Absolutely.
-真的嗎？ -當然

257
00:18:29,740 --> 00:18:32,800
-You can relax. You did great. -Yeah, thanks.
-你可以放輕鬆，你表現的很好 -謝謝

258
00:18:32,970 --> 00:18:36,930
I was really nervous. I'm told I come on too strongly.
我真的很緊張 大家都說我太喜歡講笑話緩和氣氛

259
00:18:37,110 --> 00:18:41,280
And then it was really hard to sidestep that "duty" thing.
要避開「責任」的問題真的很難

260
00:18:42,380 --> 00:18:44,410
Duties?
責任？

261
00:18:45,090 --> 00:18:47,450
Doodies?
笨蛋？

262
00:18:48,490 --> 00:18:50,510
Poo?
傻瓜？

263
00:18:51,790 --> 00:18:54,020
Poo?
傻瓜？

264
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:59,660
Oh, my God. This doesn't count. Okay? The interview was over.
天啊，這不算，好嗎？ 面試已經結束

265
00:18:59,830 --> 00:19:03,630
That was the real Chandler Bing. This is some crazy guy.
那才是真正的錢德賓 這只是個瘋子

266
00:19:03,840 --> 00:19:07,830
Call security! There's a crazy guy out in the hall!
叫警衛來！ 走廊上有個瘋子

267
00:19:08,510 --> 00:19:10,600
Poo?
傻瓜？

268
00:19:11,110 --> 00:19:14,100
I'll look forward to your call.
我期待你的來電

269
00:19:19,690 --> 00:19:21,180
-Hey. -Hey.
-嘿 -嘿

270
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:23,550
-You're back. -How are you?
-你約會回來了？ -你還好嗎？

271
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:29,060
I'm fine. But that's not important. What's important is how was she?
我很好，但那不重要 重要的是她還好嗎？

272
00:19:29,230 --> 00:19:31,820
It was fun. We just had coffee.
我們玩得很高興 我們一起去喝咖啡

273
00:19:32,030 --> 00:19:36,660
Oh, uh-huh, uh-huh, coffee, a little rub-rub-rub under the table?
喝咖啡在桌下調情？

274
00:19:37,440 --> 00:19:40,500
What's going on? Do you not like Katie?
怎麼了？ 你不喜歡凱蒂？

275
00:19:40,710 --> 00:19:46,700
No. No, she was nice. I mean, she was a little slutty, but who isn't?
不，她很好 她有點淫蕩，但誰不是呢？

276
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:48,140
Well, I liked her.
我喜歡她

277
00:19:48,350 --> 00:19:53,250
Of course you did. You'd date a gorilla if it called you lndiana Jones.
你當然喜歡她，只要猩猩叫你 印第安納瓊斯，你也會跟他約會

278
00:19:54,390 --> 00:19:58,220
Did you get a fresh batch of pregnancy hormones today?
你拿到今天的 懷孕荷爾蒙報告嗎？

279
00:19:58,390 --> 00:20:02,020
No. It's just that.. Katie bothered me.
不，那只是… 凱蒂讓我覺得困擾

280
00:20:02,230 --> 00:20:04,990
Why? What was wrong with her?
為什麼？她有哪裡不好？

281
00:20:05,270 --> 00:20:08,720
There was nothing wrong with her. She was lovely.
她沒有哪裡不好 她非常可愛

282
00:20:08,970 --> 00:20:12,960
-Okay. So, what's the matter? -I don't want you to date her.
-好吧，怎麼了？ -我不希望你跟她約會

283
00:20:13,210 --> 00:20:16,510
Why? What, are you jealous?
為什麼？你在吃醋嗎？

284
00:20:16,710 --> 00:20:20,610
Yes. And not because I want you to go out with me.
對 但不是因為我要你跟我交往

285
00:20:20,780 --> 00:20:24,380
Because I don't want you to go out with anybody.
因為我不希望 你跟任何人交往

286
00:20:24,590 --> 00:20:28,490
It's terrible to even think this and it's inappropriate..
光想到這一點我就不舒服 那是不對的…

287
00:20:28,690 --> 00:20:33,750
but I want you to be at my constant beck and call,24 hours a day.
但我希望你每天24小時 都能陪在我身邊

288
00:20:34,060 --> 00:20:38,120
I'm very sorry, but that is just the way that I feel.
我非常抱歉 但那就是我的感覺

289
00:20:41,100 --> 00:20:43,590
-Okay. -What?
-好吧 -什麼？

290
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:47,870
I won't date. I'll..
我不約會，我會…

291
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:50,910
I'll be here with you all the time.
我會一直陪著你

292
00:20:52,650 --> 00:20:54,770
Really?
真的嗎？

293
00:20:55,580 --> 00:20:58,810
But I'm being so unreasonable.
但我的要求很無理

294
00:20:59,890 --> 00:21:05,290
True, but you're allowed to be unreasonable. You're having our baby.
沒錯，但你可以無理取鬧 你懷了我們的寶寶

295
00:21:09,630 --> 00:21:13,760
Oh, Ross, thank you. Thank you.
羅斯，謝謝你

296
00:21:16,570 --> 00:21:19,040
You feel better?
你覺得好多了嗎？

297
00:21:19,310 --> 00:21:23,330
No, not really. You're pressing the baby into my bladder..
真的沒有 你把寶寶壓在我的膀胱上…

298
00:21:23,540 --> 00:21:25,880
and now I have to pee.
現在我得去尿尿

299
00:21:26,050 --> 00:21:27,270
-Okay. -Rach?
-好吧 -瑞秋

300
00:21:27,450 --> 00:21:30,750
-Yeah? -Just one thing..
-什麼事？ -只有一件事…

301
00:21:31,550 --> 00:21:37,510
We live together. You're having our baby. I'm not gonna see anybody else.
我們住在一起，你懷了我們的孩子 我不跟任何人約會

302
00:21:37,690 --> 00:21:41,630
Are you sure you don't want something more?
你確定 你不想更進一步嗎？

303
00:21:44,160 --> 00:21:48,160
Wow. I don't know, maybe..
我不知道，或許吧…

304
00:21:48,370 --> 00:21:51,930
Oh, Rach, I was just messing around.
瑞秋，我只是在開你玩笑

305
00:21:53,210 --> 00:21:57,440
-Like you did when I had to pee? -Oh! I knew that.
-就像我要尿尿時你做的一樣 -我就知道

306
00:21:57,610 --> 00:22:00,810
I knew that! I was just messing with you too!
我就知道 我也是在開你玩笑

307
00:22:03,180 --> 00:22:06,210
Okay. Because for a minute you seemed..
好吧 因為你看起來似乎…

308
00:22:06,450 --> 00:22:09,480
-No, it's just.. -Like you actually..
-不，那是… -像是你真的…

309
00:22:09,660 --> 00:22:12,590
That's just because I'm such a good messer!
那只是因為 我很會開玩笑

310
00:22:18,900 --> 00:22:20,130
-Rach? -Yeah?
-瑞秋 -什麼？

311
00:22:20,330 --> 00:22:22,830
-The bathroom? -Right.
-你要上廁所 -對

312
00:22:26,370 --> 00:22:29,500
I had a great time. I learned how to bake, ate great food.
我非常愉快，我學會了烤東西 吃美食

313
00:22:29,680 --> 00:22:34,980
It's my first A since 7th grade and I didn't even sleep with the teacher.
這是我從七年級後第一次得到優等 我甚至沒有跟老師上床

314
00:22:35,680 --> 00:22:38,580
-Oh, look. Acting for Beginners. -Yeah.
-你看，初級戲劇班 -對

315
00:22:38,990 --> 00:22:42,510
-Wanna feel good about yourself? -What the hell!
-你想更滿意自己嗎？ -管它的

316
00:22:42,690 --> 00:22:45,180
Let's start with some basics.
我們從基礎開始吧

317
00:22:45,390 --> 00:22:51,090
Can anybody tell me what the difference between upstage and downstage is?
誰能告訴我 後台跟前台的差別？

318
00:22:57,100 --> 00:23:00,010
Yeah, this was a stupid idea.
對，這個點子很蠢

319
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


320
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
